      "WELLBEING|CRISIS": "I am very concerned about you. Please contact the counselling line RIGHT NOW: 0800-XXX-XXXX.",
      "WELLBEING|DISTRESSED": "It sounds like you are going through a really difficult time. Have you spoken to anyone about how you are feeling?",
      "WELLBEING|STRESSED": "Things seem to be piling up. Let us slow down — what is weighing on you most right now?",
      "ACADEMIC|DISTRESSED": "Falling behind can feel overwhelming. Your faculty academic support office can help — shall we find their contact?",
      "ACADEMIC|STRESSED": "Exam pressure is real. Have you spoken to your tutor about what support your faculty offers?",
      "SOCIAL|CRISIS": "Feeling completely alone is serious. Please reach out to the counselling service today: 0800-XXX-XXXX.",
      "SOCIAL|DISTRESSED": "Feeling isolated is incredibly hard. The student union runs weekly social events — would that help?",
      "FINANCIAL|*": "Financial difficulty is more common than you think. The bursary office can help — shall I give you their contact?",
      "TECHNICAL|*": "Let me help with that technical issue. Which system are you trying to access?",
      "ADMIN|*": "I can help with that admin question. Which office or form do you need?",
      "WELLBEING": "It sounds like a tough time. Would you like to talk more about how you are feeling?",
      "ACADEMIC": "Let us look at what academic support is available. Have you checked with your faculty office?",
